## Mobile App Testing

### Android Specific Features

**Working with Android Activities:**
```java
// Start specific activity
driver.startActivity(
    "com.example.app",
    ".MainActivity"
);

// Get current activity
String activity = driver.currentActivity();
System.out.println("Current Activity: " + activity);

// Get app package
String package = driver.getCurrentPackage();
System.out.println("Current Package: " + package);
```

**ADB Commands Through Appium:**
```java
// Execute shell command
String output = driver.executeScript(
    "mobile: shell",
    ImmutableMap.of("command", "getprop ro.build.version.release")
);

