                "percent", 3.0
            ));

            // Wait for new posts to load
            wait.until((ExpectedCondition<Boolean>) d -> {
                List<WebElement> posts = d.findElements(AppiumBy.id("com.social:id/post_item"));
                return posts.size() > initialCount + (i * 5);
            });
        }

